<Layout
  title="Global Digital Nomad Visa Index & Income Threshold Database | NomadPassportIndex"
  description="Explore 38+ sovereign Digital Nomad Visas filtered by region and monthly income thresholds (<$2k, $2k-$4k, $4k+). Track statutory requirements, processing times, and tax exemption frameworks."
  schema={combinedSchema}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative pt-12 pb-16 border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/60 via-[#030712] to-[#030712]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        38 Sovereign Visas Verified • Statutory 2026 Edition
      </div>

      <!-- EXACTLY ONE H1 TAG -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Global Digital Nomad Visa Index & <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-yellow-300 to-amber-500">Income Threshold Database</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- FEATURED SNIPPET QUICK ANSWER BOX (45-60 WORDS) -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 text-left mb-10 backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          <span>⚡</span> Quick Answer (The Digital Nomad Visa Standard)
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-200 text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
          A digital nomad visa grants remote workers legal residency to live in a foreign country while employed abroad. Requirements typically mandate minimum monthly income thresholds ranging from $1,200 to $5,000+, comprehensive international health insurance, clear criminal background checks, and proof of remote employment or client contracts with non-local entities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Metrics Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
